{"_t":"finding","entity":"GovMap JS API (govmap.getLayerEntities)","field":"provider","value":"Survey of Israel (Mapi) / gov.il - official national mapping authority","source_key":"api.govmap.gov.il/docs/javascript-functions/get-layer-entities"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"GovMap JS API (govmap.getLayerEntities)","field":"access","value":"Client-side JS function govmap.getLayerEntities({layerName, token}) embedded in a page using the GovMap JS SDK; no plain REST/JSON HTTP endpoint documented - must run inside a browser context with the SDK loaded","source_key":"api.govmap.gov.il/docs/javascript-functions/get-layer-entities"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"GovMap JS API (govmap.getLayerEntities)","field":"auth","value":"api-key (Token) - free registration, issued PER DOMAIN: token bound to registering domain, invalid from another origin. Registration flow steps not directly confirmed (old registration page ECONNRESET); confirmed only via search snippet of docs text.","source_key":"query:govmap token registration domain-bound developer"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"GovMap JS API (govmap.getLayerEntities)","field":"cost","value":"Free (portal itself free-to-citizens; API token registration also free per docs, no pricing page found)","source_key":"query:govmap token registration domain-bound developer"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"GovMap JS API (govmap.getLayerEntities)","field":"data_provided","value":"Per-entity: entityID + Fields[] array (FieldName, Caption, Value) where one field is SHAPE holding point geometry in ITM meters, plus arbitrary attribute fields per layer. Exact field schema for sport/school/garden layers not retrievable without a token this round.","source_key":"api.govmap.gov.il/docs/javascript-functions/get-layer-entities"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"GovMap JS API (govmap.getLayerEntities)","field":"spatial","value":"Yes - SHAPE field returns point geometry in ITM (EPSG:2039) meters, e.g. POINT (200000.48 600000.39)","source_key":"api.govmap.gov.il/docs/javascript-functions/get-layer-entities"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"GovMap JS API (govmap.getLayerEntities)","field":"cross_ref_key","value":"ITM (native coordinate system of every entity SHAPE field)","source_key":"api.govmap.gov.il/docs/javascript-functions/get-layer-entities"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"GovMap JS API (govmap.getLayerEntities)","field":"update_cadence","value":"Not documented/declared anywhere found; no per-layer lastEditDate or Frequency field surfaced in docs this round - UNVERIFIED, treat as unknown cadence","source_key":"api.govmap.gov.il/docs/javascript-functions/get-layer-entities"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"GovMap JS API (govmap.getLayerEntities)","field":"enrichment_idea","value":"If a sport-facility layer is confirmed to exist and token obtained, pull SHAPE (ITM) + Fields per entity and spatial-join to Health_Sport_Facility_V (already-verified Efshari Bari FeatureServer) on ITM proximity, or to local-authority via muni_il polygon layer (also on open WMS) for authority-level rollups","source_key":"api.govmap.gov.il/docs/javascript-functions/get-layer-entities"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"GovMap JS API (govmap.getLayerEntities)","field":"dashboard_use","value":"Not primary - low-value this round because neither update_cadence nor exact sport-layer identity/schema confirmed; at best a secondary geometry/attribute enrichment layer, not a standalone tab","source_key":"api.govmap.gov.il/docs/javascript-functions/get-layer-entities"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"GovMap JS API (govmap.getLayerEntities)","field":"israel_coverage","value":"National (approx 230+ government data layers per portal, Survey of Israel-led multi-agency collaboration)","source_key":"query:govmap token registration domain-bound developer"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"GovMap JS API (govmap.getLayerEntities)","field":"reliability","value":"Official (government/Survey of Israel), but access is gated (token+domain-bind) and undocumented for the specific sport/fitness layer this lane targeted; ToS/usage limits not found this round","source_key":"query:govmap token registration domain-bound developer"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"GovMap open WMS/WFS geoserver (open.govmap.gov.il/geoserver/opendata)","field":"provider","value":"Survey of Israel / gov.il open geoserver instance","source_key":"open.govmap.gov.il/geoserver/opendata/wms"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"GovMap open WMS/WFS geoserver (open.govmap.gov.il/geoserver/opendata)","field":"access","value":"https://open.govmap.gov.il/geoserver/opendata/wms?request=getcapabilities&service=wms - live, confirmed responding with standard WMS GetCapabilities XML","source_key":"open.govmap.gov.il/geoserver/opendata/wms"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"GovMap open WMS/WFS geoserver (open.govmap.gov.il/geoserver/opendata)","field":"auth","value":"none (public WMS, no token needed, confirmed by successful anonymous fetch)","source_key":"open.govmap.gov.il/geoserver/opendata/wms"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"GovMap open WMS/WFS geoserver (open.govmap.gov.il/geoserver/opendata)","field":"data_provided","value":"Cadastral/hydro layers only: Nikuz (drainage basins), PARCEL_ALL, Parcels_ITM, SUB_GUSH_ALL, SUB_GUSH_ALL_ITM, muni_il (municipal authority polygons), nechalim1 (streams), WATER_FLOW - NO sport/school/garden/public-building layers present on this open endpoint","source_key":"open.govmap.gov.il/geoserver/opendata/wms"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"GovMap open WMS/WFS geoserver (open.govmap.gov.il/geoserver/opendata)","field":"spatial","value":"Yes - full WMS/WFS geoserver, ITM-projected layers","source_key":"open.govmap.gov.il/geoserver/opendata/wms"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"GovMap open WMS/WFS geoserver (open.govmap.gov.il/geoserver/opendata)","field":"cross_ref_key","value":"ITM; muni_il layer gives local-authority polygons usable as a join/boundary layer","source_key":"open.govmap.gov.il/geoserver/opendata/wms"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"GovMap open WMS/WFS geoserver (open.govmap.gov.il/geoserver/opendata)","field":"enrichment_idea","value":"Use muni_il polygons as authoritative local-authority boundary layer to spatially assign every sport-facility point (from Efshari Bari / data.gov.il pillar 408) to its local authority when the source record own authority field is missing/stale","source_key":"open.govmap.gov.il/geoserver/opendata/wms"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"GovMap open WMS/WFS geoserver (open.govmap.gov.il/geoserver/opendata)","field":"dashboard_use","value":"Boundary/basemap layer under map visuals (municipal polygons for choropleth), not a facility-data source itself","source_key":"open.govmap.gov.il/geoserver/opendata/wms"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"GovMap open WMS/WFS geoserver (open.govmap.gov.il/geoserver/opendata)","field":"israel_coverage","value":"National","source_key":"open.govmap.gov.il/geoserver/opendata/wms"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"GovMap open WMS/WFS geoserver (open.govmap.gov.il/geoserver/opendata)","field":"reliability","value":"Official, open, unauthenticated - high reliability for what it covers, but does NOT cover sport facilities so off-lane for the primary goal","source_key":"open.govmap.gov.il/geoserver/opendata/wms"}
