{"_t":"finding","entity":"GovMap Appendix B (enum page)","field":"data_provided","value":"NOT a layer/data enum - documents JS SDK constants only: govmap.events (PAN, EXTENT_CHANGE, CLICK...), cursorType, geometryType, drawType, rendererType, geocodeType, saveActions/saveActionStatus, layerFilterFields. Irrelevant to layer discovery. Appendix A (partial table: SUB_GUSH_ALL, PARCEL_ALL, kids_g, school, bus_stops, GASSTATIONS) is the relevant one but full table not retrievable (SPA truncation) and does not list numeric lay= ids matching sport/fitness/public-building/garden","source_key":"api.govmap.gov.il/docs/intro/attache-b"}
